/F2 9 Tf (## 1. Executive Summary) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
(A Software-Defined Vessel \(SDV\) cannot treat human crew availability as a mere scheduling annotation: ) Tj T*
(crew count directly governs **which physical payload transitions are admissible**, **how many deck ) Tj T*
(evolutions can execute concurrently**, **whether at-sea vehicle replacement \($A'$\) is physically ) Tj T*
(safe**, and **how fault recovery escalates when telemetry degrades or a payload overconsumes**. In ) Tj T*
(`sdv-resource-governor`, human crew availability is enforced as a hard operational guard inside ) Tj T*
(`scheduling.py` and `admission.py`.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(---) Tj T*
() Tj T*
